      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That constant performance is soul-crushing, and it makes perfect sense that you feel so profoundly tired. When the effort to maintain the mask is this extreme, the noise of the world becomes unbearable. Sometimes, the most radical act of self-care is recognizing that the performance doesn't have to continue at this level, even if it's just for a tiny moment. You don't have to *do* anything right now except acknowledge how much you are struggling.",
      "source": "target",
