    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. but even \"acknowledging it\" feels like more work. like i'm just adding another task to my list. i look at the scale of it all, the years ahead of me just repeating this same empty loop, and it's terrifying. i just want it to be quiet. i want to stop feeling the pressure to keep everything moving. i just want to find a way to make the noise stop for good.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
